# The pad with the barrel by the hut (map 4, its window on the left) and the backpack (better inventory) open: at the start of the backpack's row the pick goes left over into the barrel, at the row nearest the height it left at (the tableware), and on its last thing right over into the backpack's top row
args: --map 4 --pos 10624,10060,48
do: option:better_inventory,on;pack:418;pack:420;pack:816;pack:814;pack:843;pack:793,1;pack:793,3
do: t5;operate:36462;t10;inv;t5;pickwin:-1;pickrow:-1;pickwin:-1;pickwin:1;pickwin:1
expect: pickwin: id 36740
expect: pickrow: true id 36734
expect: pickwin: id 36466 shape  181
expect: pickwin: id 36464 shape  830
expect: pickwin: id 36734 shape  418
reject: pickwin: id 36463
